    "content": "<p>Senior full-stack engineer with 5+ years shipping production software, focused on LLM systems: interview and task pipelines with evals at Jobflow, RAG and multi-agent pipelines at QTech AI (now Qorelo), a streaming AI chat flow at 8Returns. Co-founded Undrstnd Labs and built Dukkani and Sonaraem. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://gitista.com/search/?country=TN&handle=FindMalek\">#1 open-source contributor in Tunisia on Gitista</a>, 7,000+ lifetime GitHub contributions (3,057 in the last 12 months).</p>"
  },
