            "url": "https://www.jobflow.de",
            "label": "jobflow.de",
            "inlineLink": true
          },
          "description": "<ul><li><p>Build the AI pipelines behind <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.findmalek.com/work/jobflow#interview-confirmation-and-task-extraction\">interview confirmation and task extraction</a>: refactored the interview analyzer and built the task extractor, scored by eval datasets and rolled out behind a feature flag.</p></li><li><p>Retired the old v1 to v3 pipelines after rollout, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.findmalek.com/work/jobflow#interview-confirmation-and-task-extraction\">deleting about 16,000 lines</a>.</p></li><li><p>Cut the admin user-search estimate <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.findmalek.com/work/jobflow#search-that-stopped-being-slow\">from about 90 s to 100 ms</a> on near-production data (about 900x), with a PostGIS geography column and a partial GIST index.</p></li><li><p>Run the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.findmalek.com/work/jobflow#evals-and-tracing\">Braintrust evaluation and tracing setup</a> for the AI services: fixture datasets, an end-to-end chain eval with an LLM judge, and production traces. Evals also gated a switch to cheaper models for non-sensitive prompts.</p></li><li><p>Extended the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.findmalek.com/work/jobflow#cv-and-cover-letter-rendering\">CV and cover letter smoke tests</a> to render every template to PDF.</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.findmalek.com/work/jobflow#by-the-numbers\">332 merged PRs and 315 PRs reviewed</a>, top 10 of 47 contributors by commits.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
          "roles": []
        },
